{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/71477c4506cfd07b41a9f0ebbc6296e1.avif?t=1761318036\" width=800 height=276 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc0\ud83e\uddc0 <strong>Billie\u2019s Wheelie</strong> \ud83e\uddc0\ud83e\uddc0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for <strong>high-speed hamster chaos!</strong> \ud83d\udc39\ud83d\udca8<br>In this <strong>fast-paced adventure racing platformer</strong>, you take control of <strong>Billie, an adorable hamster on a mission to roll, race, and zoom through wild, dynamic tracks</strong>. Jump, dodge, and boost your way to <strong>victory</strong>, all while collecting <strong>cheese</strong> \ud83e\uddc0 and <strong>outplaying your opponents!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>ONLINE  FAST-PACED RACING ACTION!\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfc1<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/937122c79df5f0c1eba55acf934ebca0.avif?t=1761318036\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed through intense tracks</strong> designed to <strong>test your reflexes</strong>! With <strong>fluid movement, tricky obstacles, and crazy jumps</strong>!\u00a0<strong>with 2 to 8 players online!</strong><br><strong>Master precise controls</strong> to drift, dodge, and boost your way past competitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HAMSTER!</strong> \ud83d\udc39</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/f9726aa685bf74da72deb8e9014cf8d6.avif?t=1761318036\" data-has-big width=800 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your <strong>adorable</strong> <strong>hamster look</strong>, roll in a <strong>custom ball</strong>, and <strong>leave a trail mark\u00a0</strong>as you speed through the tracks. and\u00a0<strong>Celebrate your victories in style</strong> with <strong>hilarious victory emotes </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>EXPLORE DYNAMIC TRACKS!</strong> \ud83c\udfc1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/fd05d8582d6bd5d98328d2e1da8960d1.avif?t=1761318036\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through <strong>stunning environments</strong>, from <strong>Candy World to  Space tracks</strong>, each packed with exciting surprises! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>SUN FLOWER SUPER POWER-UPS </strong> \ud83c\udfa2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/c69c0eadd2d468f77df4b360b50cb685.avif?t=1761318036\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize your way to victory</strong> with well-timed boosts, shields, and sneaky tricks to outplay the competition, By Unleashing\u00a0<strong>crazy power-ups</strong> to <strong>boost past rivals, slow down opponents, and create total chaos\u00a0</strong>on the track!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f <strong>MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udccc</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode,  Challenges &amp; MORE updates!</strong><br><strong>New levels, features, and surprises are coming!</strong> The race never stops in <strong>Billie\u2019s Wheelie!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>ROLL, RACE &amp; CHEEEEEEEESE YOUR WAY TO VICTORY!\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udf89 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc39\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Are you ready for a crazy hamster racing adventure?</strong> Jump in now and experience <strong>the thrill of speed and cheese-fueled fun!</strong> \ud83e\uddc0\ud83c\udfc6</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Die 1 time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/c9d4ce2d5456102c78474d62ba980a97e7a19105.jpg"},{"name":"Die 2 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/78959ad77da27d5412ce7e5d45e7503968e76a99.jpg"},{"name":"Die 7 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/be801cda662c6cada0ba065ab984171d6cd2e139.jpg"},{"name":"Die 10 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/f48aa8e4f3e628fcc5b022bde885203932bff626.jpg"},{"name":"Die 50 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/7cf08715e9ea786c65bb51042036d93f82ed0a7d.jpg"},{"name":"Die 51 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/8cd9c6a28c7c8fb2ca15aee58dc199c1b4ad3af0.jpg"},{"name":"Die 95 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/c2de2b64ce88f5bbf81b5d1b64546c51a4b062b8.jpg"},{"name":"Die 100 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/693bca668fb9c44b07caba6743c3e37b886f60ab.jpg"},{"name":"Die 500 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/b3ada972af67e5299b7079147ce844bda0bc1ac1.jpg"},{"name":"Die 1000 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180310/d57a19cdf0f372e1104d32c4c2cb07e66931fee0.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180310?t=1761318036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/5a19d5d5817367ec77cc5db57b58d595a91f1eb3/page_bg_raw.j